Changes:
 ros-jazzy-legged-controllers (3.6.0-2026.10.19.06.19) noble; urgency=high
 .
   * Template ControllerBase on the controller interface base
     Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <mailto:noreply@anthropic.com>
     Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01A2pd46YwYV5pUbH2WJmrKG
   * Resolve the external localization frame from the odometry message
     The estimation.position.frame_id parameter duplicated what every
     nav_msgs/Odometry already carries: child_frame_id names the robot frame
     the reported pose applies to. Read it from the message instead, caching
     the pinocchio frame lookup until the name changes. A child_frame_id
     that is not in the robot description skips the correction with a
     throttled error, and everything else the estimator produces keeps
     running.
     Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <mailto:noreply@anthropic.com>
     Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WUhufQkrqJ2LMQEaNq787e
   * Contributors: qiayuanl
